This directory holds the buddy's autopilot: the code that plays the game for an order (finding, gathering, crafting,
fighting, building) and the pathfinder under it.

It comes from three projects:

- Baritone (https://github.com/cabaletta/baritone), LGPL-3.0: the pathfinder. Its files keep their own headers.
- AltoClef by Adris Jautakas (https://github.com/gaucho-matrero/altoclef), MIT: the tasks. See LICENSE-AltoClef.
- Soprano by AverWasTaken (https://github.com/AverWasTaken/soprano), LGPL-3.0: both brought to Minecraft 26.3, taken
  at its commit 887da394545865676379e23a53c04e50f068c1ec.

Changed by the Minecraft Buddy project since November 2026.

